# What this repository produces, and nothing else. Machine-wide noise —
# .DS_Store, editor swap files, .env — is declared once in the global ignore
# this repository manages (home/dot_gitignore), never a second time
# here.

# Agent worktrees: a full checkout of this repository per task.
.claude/worktrees/

# Machine-local agent settings. A shared .claude/settings.json is tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
